 <h3><u>Aye Zaire Hussain assalam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial,= sans-serif;= line-height:= normal;= border-collapse:= collapse;= color:= rgb(34,= 34,= 34);= =></span></p>
  <div>
   Abad Wallah Ya Zehra (s.a.) Manind Sa Hussaina (a.s.).....3
   <br>As Salam....3 Aai Zair E Hussain Assalam
   <br>
   <br>Labbaik Ya Hussain (A.s)....4
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....2
   <br>
   <br>Allah (S.w.t.) ki Bahisht Ke Haqdar Assalam
   <br>Aai Turbate Hussain (A.s.) Ke Zawwar Assalam
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Tujhpar Salam Shaam O Sahar Zair E Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>Zair Hai Tere Shams O Kamar Zair E Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>Khud Keh Rahe Hai Ahle Khabar Zair E Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>Tu Tha Gunagar Magar Zair E Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>Tera Thikana Barsare Aflak Ho Gaya
   <br>Zam Zam Sada e Deta Hai Tu Paak Ho Gaya
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Haj Ka Sawab Lekar Utha Tera Har Kadam
   <br>Rakha Kadam Zameen Pe To Umrah Hua Rakam
   <br>Aawaz Aa Rahi Hai Yeh Nabion Ki Dam Ba Dam
   <br>Tu Zair E Hussain (A.s.) Tere Zaireen Hai Hum
   <br>Deedar Kar Ke Rauzae Sarwar Ka Farsh Par
   <br>Tu Ne Khuda Ko Dekhliya Jaake Arsh Par
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Khola Hai Rab Ne Bab E Fazilat Tere Liye
   <br>Kudsi bhi Kar Rahe Hai Ibadat Tere Liye
   <br>Kausar Hai Tere Waaste Jannat Tere Liye
   <br>Arfe Ke Roz Hai Yeh Saadat Tere Liye
   <br>Mumtaz Kar Diya Tere Masjood Ne Tujhe
   <br>Haji se Pehle Deha Hai &nbsp;Mabood Ne Tujhe
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Tujhko Dua E Binte Payambar Naaseeb Hai
   <br>Kismat Ko Naaz Hai Woh Mukaddar Naseeb Hai
   <br>Tera Malaika Se Bhi Badh Kar Naseeb Hai
   <br>Kya Martaba Tujhe Share Mhehshar Naseeb Hai
   <br>Jub Naseeran e Shah Ko Khalik Bulaienga
   <br>Mhehshar Me Tu Bhi Sath Bahattar Ke Jaienga
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Haj Ke Bagair Haj Ka Fariza Ada Kiya
   <br>Mausam Ki Koi Fikr Na Khaufe Kaza Kiya
   <br>Chalo Se Apne Marhame Zakhme Ana Kiya
   <br>Tune Barahna Pa Safar E Karbala Kiya
   <br>Katre Tere Pasine Ke Kya Kaam Aaie Hai
   <br>Allah (S.w.t.) Ne Unhi Se Farishte Banaie Hai
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Kis tarha Se Bayan Ho Manzar Woh Ish Ke
   <br>Paidal Jo Karbala Ko Nikalte Hai Kaafle
   <br>Koi Najaf Se Aur Koi Basrah Ki Rah Se
   <br>Hathon Me Ya Hussain (A.s.) Ke Parcham Liye Hue
   <br>Zair Jo Karbala Ki Taraf Daude Jaate Hai
   <br>Abbas (A.s.) Chal Ke Khud Unhe Lene Ko Aate Hai
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Hoti Hai Ek Katar E Mawkib Wahan Saji
   <br>Khidmat Me Zaieereen Ki Rehta Hai Har Koi
   <br>Pani Liye Koi To Koi Ban Ke Malishi
   <br>Un Khadimon Ke Ishk Pe Kehta Hai Dil Yahi
   <br>Karte Hai Saaf Aa Ke Pasina Jabeen Se
   <br>Mil Ne Hussain (A.s.) Aate Hai Jub Khadmeen Se
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Dulhan Ki Tarha Rah Sajate Hai Aashikeen
   <br>Khaime Mohabbaton Ke Lagate Hai Aashikeen
   <br>Jo Saal Bhar Me Risk Kamate Hai Aashikeen
   <br>Daulat Woh Zairon Pe Lutate Hai Aashikeen
   <br>Kehte Hai Phir Bhi Kalb Hamare Na Bhar Sake
   <br>Hum Zair E Hussain (A.s.) Ki Khidmat Na Kar Sake
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Jo Raste Me Karbobal Ke Guzaar Gai
   <br>Kaise Kahu Ke Mir Takallum Woh Mar Gaie
   <br>Pardes Me The Laut Ke Woh Apne Ghar Gaie
   <br>Aaie Ajal Bataun Woh Zair Kidhar Gaie
   <br>Dare Fana Se Mulk E Baka Legaie Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>Khud Aake Unko Karbobala Le Gaie Hussain (A.s.)
   <br>
   <br>Aai Zair E Hussain (A.s) Assalam.....4
   <br>
   <br>Abad Wallah Ya Zehra (s.a.) Manind Sa Hussaina (A.s.).....2
   <br>
   <br>As Salam .....3
